 "titulo": "The monkey who wanted to never die 🐒 Sun Wukong Part 2 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "HE WILL NOT DIE",
 "descripcion": "The Monkey King cries because one day he will die. So he crosses the sea to find a teacher who knows the secret of living forever.\n\n> Part 3: {when_next}.\nWould you have found the secret door?\n\nFrom Journey to the West (Xiyouji), Wu Cheng'en, 16th century, chapters 1 and 2.\n#monkeyking #sunwukong #journeytothewest #mythology #shorts",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Imagine having everything, and knowing it will end.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The Monkey King cries because one day he will *die*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "An old monkey says only immortals escape death.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "So the king sails alone across the sea on a raft.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "For years, he walks through towns, learning to act like people.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "At last, he finds a temple and an old master, *Subodhi*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The master names him *Sun Wukong*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "For seven years, Wukong only sweeps floors.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then Subodhi hits his head three times and leaves.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The students laugh. Wukong understands the *secret*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because this is how he learned his magic.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Three knocks meant the third watch of the night, at the *back door*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "At midnight, the back door is open.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "In secret, he learns *seventy-two transformations*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "And the cloud somersault, a jump of thousands of miles.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "But one day, he shows off and becomes a pine tree.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Subodhi sends him away. Never tell anyone *who taught you*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Back home, a demon has taken his mountain.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He needs a weapon, and the right one is under the sea. Part three, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
